{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1709, "text": "Wow. You're not going to believe who got\nnamed one of the ten most interesting"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5210, "text": "men in New York."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 8350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6390, "text": "If it's you, I'm moving to New Jersey."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 12490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11250, "text": "Judge Harold T. Stone."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 15750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13090, "text": "Interesting. You've got to be kidding."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 21330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17070, "text": "Nope. He's right here. Sandwiched\nbetween Lawrence Taylor and JFK Jr."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 24210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22150, "text": "There's one sandwich I'd love to be part\nof."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 29110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26510, "text": "Boy, I bet Harry's going to be excited\nabout this."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 30590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29470, "text": "No, not Harry."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 35880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31620, "text": "He's probably holed up in his office too\nembarrassed to even show his face."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 38020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36460, "text": "Lucky, lucky, lucky!"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 42440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39280, "text": "Guess who's the most interesting judge\nin New York?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 45080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42740, "text": "Of course, some people like to flaunt\ntheir embarrassment."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 49180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46460, "text": "Congratulations, sir. How does it feel\nto be famous?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 51120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49500, "text": "Ah, boy, it's no big deal."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 55620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51320, "text": "In fact, the whole thing's kind of\nsilly, isn't it? Yes, sir. Real silly."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 58940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56660, "text": "I didn't say real silly."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 62970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59870, "text": "I'm at least as interesting as JFK Jr.,\naren't I?"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 65090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63430, "text": "Not in the Tiger Prince Speedo."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 70310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66710, "text": "I think it's great, sir. Being on this\nlist will get you invited to all kinds"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 71310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70310, "text": "glamorous events."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 74030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71910, "text": "Charity balls, inaugurations."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 77250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74670, "text": "Hey, Harry, I've asked those tickets to\nthe ice capades."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 79590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78270, "text": "Wow, it's starting already."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 84370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81450, "text": "Christine, do you know you're going to\nbe taking one of the most interesting"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 85309, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84370, "text": "in New York?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 86310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85310, "text": "No, I'm taking Harry."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 89610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87910, "text": "He was referring to..."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 90850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89850, "text": "This list."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 92670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91590, "text": "Kind of silly, huh?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 94810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93430, "text": "You're supposed to say no."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 97610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96350, "text": "This is great, Harry."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 101090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98030, "text": "I just hope an interesting guy like you\nstill has time to go to the ice capades."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 105450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101310, "text": "Don't worry. I always love watching a\nguy do triple axles in a worn -out Smurf"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 106450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105450, "text": "costume."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 108910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107050, "text": "Harry, the Smurfs are passe."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 110810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109430, "text": "This year they have Marmaduke."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 114310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112690, "text": "Jack, I've come to settle my tab."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 116930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114810, "text": "Here. Five hundred dollars."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 118970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117630, "text": "You only owe me $2 .75."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 123930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120190, "text": "Think of it as a penance for all of the\nwretched treatment I have heaped upon"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 126730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 123930, "text": "you in the past, dear vendor."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 132550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129070, "text": "Whoever it is impersonating Fielding,\nyou got the voice right, but the words"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 133550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 132550, "text": "all wrong."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 138430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134570, "text": "What's up with Dan? He's giving me the\ncreeps. It's the Phil Foundation."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 140110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138670, "text": "It's turned him into a human being."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 141450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140450, "text": "Yeah, right."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 142710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141710, "text": "Watch this."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 144090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143090, "text": "Yo, Dan."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 146790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 144130, "text": "Yes. Guess who's more interesting than\nyou are?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 149820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 148780, "text": "Burns you up, doesn't it?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 153640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151080, "text": "Actually, I can't think of a more\ndeserving soul."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 156440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155420, "text": "Kudos, dear friend."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 159840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 158840, "text": "Kudos."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 163920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160900, "text": "Well, now I know what it feels like to\nlive in a parallel universe."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 167200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164920, "text": "Wow, what an interesting thing to say."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 215370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214190, "text": "Hey, what's all this stuff?"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 222130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215690, "text": "Oh, this is my goldfish orca, my giraffe\ntoo tall, and my lamp sparky."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 228490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224390, "text": "Good. Now that we're all on a first\n-name basis, what the hell are they"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 229490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228490, "text": "here?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 232750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230030, "text": "I broke up with my boyfriend, Curtis."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 237670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233030, "text": "After living with him for three years, I\nfinally realized we are not a good"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 240390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237670, "text": "match. I give, he takes."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 243710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240610, "text": "I cook, he eats. I clean, he messes."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 246230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244750, "text": "Actually, we are a good match."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 248570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246950, "text": "It's a big drag for me."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 250850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249290, "text": "Well, at least you're taking a stand."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 252090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251090, "text": "You moved out."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 256670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252790, "text": "No, he kicked me out. You see, he kicks,\nI go."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 261529, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257970, "text": "Well, I'm real sorry about Curtis, but\nyou can't keep this stuff here."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 264530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262050, "text": "But I have no place to put it."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 269200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268140, "text": "Don't look at me like that."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 271820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270620, "text": "Don't you do this to me."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 277060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274780, "text": "Okay, I guess I can keep some of it in\nmy place."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 280000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277760, "text": "Damn, I hate having anything cute in my\napartment."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 284620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 283620, "text": "Now what?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 286440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284760, "text": "I've got no place to put me."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 290780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288880, "text": "I don't believe I'm saying this."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 294750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292430, "text": "Okay, you can stay with me until you\nfind your own place."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 297070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294970, "text": "But Mr. Too Tall sleeps on the fire\nescape."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 300110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298710, "text": "But he'll get chilly."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 302750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301750, "text": "Don't push it."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 305750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304430, "text": "No, no."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 309370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306090, "text": "Rabbi Sandro, I won't give your soup\nkitchen $30 ,000."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 312210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310050, "text": "I insist on giving you $50 ,000."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 314590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313490, "text": "No need to thank me."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 317670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316630, "text": "Shalom to you, too."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 321510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320250, "text": "What are you up to, Dan?"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 323200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 322200, "text": "Phil's work."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 328820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323900, "text": "You know something? For the first time\nin years, I actually feel pure."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 335240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331140, "text": "Tonight, I'm going to take all my\nnaughty magazines and haul them to the"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 337620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336260, "text": "You must have a ton of those."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 339240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337980, "text": "Careful you don't pull anything."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 342980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341740, "text": "That's why I'm getting rid of them."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 349400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348400, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 356250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350180, "text": "Criminal court. Part two is now in\nsession. The honorable and interesting"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 357430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356250, "text": "T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 360550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357970, "text": "Thank you. Thank you. But enough about\nme."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 362630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361150, "text": "Let's hear something from our clerk."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 365490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362950, "text": "Yes, sir. People versus Twinkie."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 368890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367890, "text": "Solicitation."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 371330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369310, "text": "Prosecution. Yes, sir. Here's the police\nreport."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 374630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372550, "text": "She's been a bad girl."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 380150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376910, "text": "Defense? Well, bad is a relative term,\nYour Honor."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 384510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380570, "text": "Yeah, relatively incriminating in this\ncase. Fifty dollars in time, sir."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 387430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385250, "text": "You're a very interesting man."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 393390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390750, "text": "Good news travels fast, huh, Mac? Yeah."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 395050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394050, "text": "What's next?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 399910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395150, "text": "Phone messages, sir. Ever since you made\nthat list, the calls have been pouring"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 400910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399910, "text": "in."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 406030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401390, "text": "The curator of the Museum of Natural\nHistory wants me to dedicate their new"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 407290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406030, "text": "woolly mammoth wing."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 415030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409130, "text": "The Italian ambassador wants me to play\npolo. They like me, Mac. They really"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 416030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415030, "text": "like me."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 422910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417570, "text": "If they can just hold their horses,\nbecause I've got a court to run."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 424230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423170, "text": "That's it, sir."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 427010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424470, "text": "Don't let all that celebrity poop go to\nyour head."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 428270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427270, "text": "Oh, I almost forgot."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 430890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428590, "text": "Meryl Streep wants to rehearse a theme\nwith you."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 433590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432590, "text": "That's a five."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 446340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444720, "text": "Want to get in on a little pool?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 448760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447600, "text": "Football season already?"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 452200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449340, "text": "Actually, we're taking bets on when Roz\nwill lose her temper with Lissette."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 456220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453820, "text": "And what instrument of destruction\nshe'll employ."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 460060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458260, "text": "There's still some good squares left."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 462140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460660, "text": "Tuesday with a steam iron."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 465400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463860, "text": "Thursday with a frying pan."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 467920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466220, "text": "And Friday with a Barker lounger."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 470880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469880, "text": "So, are you in?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 472320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471240, "text": "No, thanks, guys."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 474540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473200, "text": "No thanks, guys."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 475840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474800, "text": "God, is he interesting."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 480660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479000, "text": "Wow, that's for me? Yeah."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 485220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481900, "text": "To my conga line buddy, Love Amber."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 486699, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485760, "text": "Who's that?"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 487700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486700, "text": "Miss January."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 490900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489600, "text": "Mac, isn't this something?"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 495400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491160, "text": "Just think, two days ago I was a big\nnobody, and now I am rubbing elbows with"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 496400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495400, "text": "the rich and famous."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 500580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496940, "text": "I'm even going to an art opening\ntonight. It's a big exhibit by Gunst."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 502440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501440, "text": "Gunst?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 507630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506630, "text": "Yeah,"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 512130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507990, "text": "yeah, yeah. He's this hot Norwegian\nsculptor. Everybody who is anybody is"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 513089, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 512130, "text": "to be there tonight."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 513829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513090, "text": "Hey, Harry."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 514830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513830, "text": "Great news."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 516210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514870, "text": "Big Bird's going to be there tonight."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 520270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518929, "text": "Big Bird? Tonight?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 523710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522070, "text": "Oh, the ice capades."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 526190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525170, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 528510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526590, "text": "Great. Yeah, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 532280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529260, "text": "You know, ever since I was a little\ngirl, I used to dream about being a"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 536180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532280, "text": "skater. Going to the Olympics and\nwinning a gold medal for my country."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 538660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536840, "text": "What stopped you? The skating part."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 541840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540080, "text": "That ice is so slippery."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 547560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543540, "text": "But, you know, I still love watching it.\nAnd you will, too, after tonight. See"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 548560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547560, "text": "you then."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 551900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549520, "text": "Well, I guess it's goodbye."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 556980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553340, "text": "And hello, Marmaduke."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 566550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562990, "text": "Bo, Rosalyn was set on here yet. You\ndon't suppose she's done her in already?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 568090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567090, "text": "That would be horrible."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 570250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568910, "text": "I don't have today in the pool."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 576470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572690, "text": "And then the father says, when you got a\npig like that, you don't eat them all"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 577470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576470, "text": "at once."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 581870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580310, "text": "You guys are sure getting along."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 584570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583110, "text": "Yeah. What's it to you?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 587590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586590, "text": "Nothing."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 592750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589829, "text": "Nothing. Well, so much for Tuesday with\nthe steam iron."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 599270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598270, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 605150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600810, "text": "School Court Part 2 is now in session.\nThe honorable, interesting, and"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 607610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605150, "text": "photogenic Harold T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 612250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609850, "text": "Thank you, thank you, thank you. Let's\nget a move on."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 613910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612490, "text": "It's icecapades night."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 618960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617960, "text": "Bless you, sir."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 625260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621320, "text": "Oh, thank you, Counselor. I hope I'm not\ncoming down with something."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 628720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625600, "text": "More likely coming up with something."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 632900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631520, "text": "Are you sure you're going to be all\nright?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 635640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633360, "text": "I could call a doctor. My treat, of\ncourse."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 641440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637460, "text": "No, thanks very much, guys. I'm sure I'm\ngoing to be absolutely fine."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 643700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642700, "text": "Oh,"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 646120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644160, "text": "Harry. I don't know how you made it\nthrough session."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 647980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 646880, "text": "You know, I think you have a fever."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 649240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648240, "text": "Let's see that thermometer."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 652700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649500, "text": "A tissue, please. Oh, yeah, right away."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 655500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653560, "text": "You know, Harry, there is a flu going\naround."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 658560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656020, "text": "I don't know. I think you should skip\nthe escapades tonight."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 660300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659200, "text": "No, no, Christine."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 665380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660740, "text": "I made a promise that I'm going to keep\nit, no matter how cold and drafty it is"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 666380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665380, "text": "in that arena."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 668680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 666640, "text": "Yeah, well, let's see that thermometer."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 671640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670300, "text": "Harry, you've got a temperature of 103."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 674680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672480, "text": "Okay, that's it. No escapades for you\ntonight."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 677320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 675180, "text": "But I can't let you miss those barrel\njumps."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 681140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678540, "text": "Don't worry about me, Harry. You just go\nhome and get better."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 690459, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689520, "text": "How's Harry doing?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 691460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690460, "text": "Oh, he's going to be fine."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 694080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693080, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 697340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695640, "text": "guys, I've got an extra ticket to the\nescapades."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 698660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697660, "text": "Anybody interested?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 702280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698680, "text": "Sorry, Christine. It's laundry night. I\nthought she folds."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 706880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704819, "text": "Okay, Roz, fess up. She's driving you\nnuts, right?"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 708340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707340, "text": "Not at all."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 709380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708380, "text": "She's a sweet girl."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 712420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710020, "text": "She knits sweaters for birds, but she's\nsweet."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 714960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713900, "text": "You like living alone."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 716399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715420, "text": "I do."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 718300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716400, "text": "But once in a while, it's nice to have\ncompany."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 721040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718760, "text": "Especially somebody who gets a kick out\nof sorting socks."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 724140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722220, "text": "Anyway, she's going through a rough\ntime."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 725660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724660, "text": "She needs a friend."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 728240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727240, "text": "You know something?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 732100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729160, "text": "Harry needs a friend, too. I'm going to\nsee if I can get him anything before I"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 733660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732100, "text": "go to the show. Thank you, Roz."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 737690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736170, "text": "I was just talking about socks."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 761330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755030, "text": "Mr. Fielding, this Swedish -American\ngirl posture was created to protect"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 762510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761330, "text": "and innocent..."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 768480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763120, "text": "Mostly blonde immigrants from the\nclutches of unscrupulous men."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 772440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769880, "text": "You look familiar. Do I know you from\nsomewhere?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 775600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774420, "text": "It's a big city."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 779200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776680, "text": "Lots of tall people."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 787780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781460, "text": "Well, at any rate, without your support,\nour girls will be forced out onto the"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 789600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787780, "text": "streets with the perverts."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 798860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796880, "text": "Can't shake the feeling that we have met\nsomewhere."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 804780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800860, "text": "Well, you know, they say déjà vu runs\nrampant in the spring."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 808560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806420, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 811160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809780, "text": "I remember you."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 814080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811560, "text": "You tried to sneak into the hostel one\nnight."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 819300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815760, "text": "You were wearing a blue dress and a\nfrizzy blonde wig."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 823400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820580, "text": "And you had a suitcase filled with\noysters."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 827400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826280, "text": "Actually, they were green mussels."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 833000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829280, "text": "Thank you for wasting my time. Good day,\nsir. No, wait, please."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 834420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833420, "text": "Yes,"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 839660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836780, "text": "it is true that most of my life I have\nwalked on the dark side."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 843380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840740, "text": "In fact, I was commander of the dark\nside."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 847700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846600, "text": "But I've changed."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 850160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848260, "text": "I now walk in the light."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 854360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851340, "text": "And I have realized over the last few\nweeks that I have been put..."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 856130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854570, "text": "On Earth for one reason only."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 859850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858450, "text": "To do his will."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 862410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861090, "text": "You mean the Lord?"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 865430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862730, "text": "God? No, I mean the bomb, Phil."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 870310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868750, "text": "Please take my check."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 874470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871710, "text": "My salvation depends on it."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 879790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876710, "text": "Mr. Fielding, I believe you."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 883810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882810, "text": "Hey, Phil."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 885650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884650, "text": "Dan, 17."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 887290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886290, "text": "Sin zip."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 889770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888670, "text": "Can I play the winner?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 892750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890130, "text": "Oh, sorry. We're playing best out of\n311."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 895670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894330, "text": "How many have you played so far?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 897590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896590, "text": "Four."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 899210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898210, "text": "I can wait."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 902510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901510, "text": "Lizette?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 904310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903310, "text": "Curtis."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 906750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904570, "text": "Lizette, please come home."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 909610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907130, "text": "I can't live without you. I'm on my\nknees."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 913190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910950, "text": "You're not on your knees. You're\nstanding."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 920100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914640, "text": "You're just a figure of speech, Lisette.\nOh, here we go again. You just keep"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 921840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920100, "text": "picking those nits, don't you?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 924280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922240, "text": "You want to take away my manhood?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 926760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925040, "text": "Want to borrow my gardening chair?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 930020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928140, "text": "Lisette, home."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 931900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930900, "text": "Now."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 937760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934640, "text": "Ross, I better go."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 943540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941840, "text": "Looks like you lost a roommate."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 945820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944460, "text": "Yeah, too bad."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 948980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946100, "text": "It was almost like being 16 all over\nagain."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 952320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949840, "text": "Hey, I could move in with you."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 956960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954320, "text": "I said 16, not six."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 965840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962100, "text": "You know, you'd think hanging out with\nme would have some effect on her."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 968700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966320, "text": "But I guess you can't grow a backbone\novernight."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 971060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970060, "text": "General..."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 976470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974410, "text": "Curtis. Oh, I pushed him down the\nstairs."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 981050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980050, "text": "To Harry."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 982310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981310, "text": "Love ya."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 983750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982750, "text": "Gunst."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 989250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988250, "text": "Harry."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 992150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989970, "text": "Christine. What a lovely sculpture."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 994030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992530, "text": "Where in the world did you get it?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 997830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996830, "text": "The pharmacy."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1002050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000430, "text": "Harry, I saw you leave last night."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1003630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002630, "text": "You did?"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1006970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004430, "text": "Well, I was going to see my doctor."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1008190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007190, "text": "In a tuck?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1009550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008270, "text": "He's a real formal doctor."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1014550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012630, "text": "Okay, all right. There was no doctor."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1016310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014910, "text": "There wasn't even any cold."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1019730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017370, "text": "Just going to a very exclusive art\nopening."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1023810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020490, "text": "Why couldn't you just come out and tell\nme? This isn't like you."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1025390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024390, "text": "I know."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1028069, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025709, "text": "I guess I'm just overwhelmed by all this\nattention."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1030490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028310, "text": "You know, it's not easy being the\nhottest guy in town."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1033990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030790, "text": "You're not the hottest guy in town. Oh,\nyes, I am. Oh, no, you're not. Oh, yes,"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1034990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033990, "text": "he is."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1038690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035750, "text": "Good night, New York TV. Show call to\nconfirm your appearance tonight."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1044650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043650, "text": "He's hot."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1049010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048010, "text": "Funny stuff."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1050530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049530, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1053830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050910, "text": "Two days ago, my next guest was a great\nbig nobody."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1061000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056380, "text": "Now he's the hottest guy in town, and\nwe've got him. Judge Harold T. is in"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1061959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061000, "text": "terrific stone."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1062960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061960, "text": "Come on out here."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1075500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068560, "text": "Great to be"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1076459, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075500, "text": "here, Dave."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1079080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076460, "text": "Before we start, hi, Christine."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1083660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080640, "text": "Christine, ooh, what a lovely name."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1085850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084510, "text": "Is that the lucky lady in your life?"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1087630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086290, "text": "No, she's just a friend."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1088910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087910, "text": "Just a friend."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1091070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090070, "text": "She'll love it."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1092670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091410, "text": "She'll love it. I love it."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1098010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094270, "text": "Oh, what a breath of fresh air you are,\nmy friend."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1099390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098230, "text": "You are my friend."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1101790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100790, "text": "Philosophy of life."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1102930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101930, "text": "Have you got one?"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1106670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105210, "text": "Live and let live, I guess."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1113200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109880, "text": "What an inside, the stone man speaker."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1118580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115140, "text": "So, fellas, what's it like in municipal\ncourt?"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1122240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120100, "text": "Hookers and flashers and thugs. Oh, my."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1129360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126920, "text": "Hookers. What do you give them?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1130820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129700, "text": "Whatever they want, I guess."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1139100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135840, "text": "Oh, I'll tell a $50 fine in time served.\nThat's the usual."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1144040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142440, "text": "Fascinating. Yeah, it is, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1149700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144520, "text": "You know, Dave, in my eight years on the\nbench, I guess I've seen it all. And we"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1152960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149700, "text": "want to hear all about it. So, hold on\nto your hats, folks."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1158600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153200, "text": "We're coming right back with the most\ninteresting of them all, Harry Stone."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1162140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161140, "text": "We're clear."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1165260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163100, "text": "Check this out."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1169260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166740, "text": "The ten even more interesting men in New\nYork?"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1171770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170770, "text": "Stone's not on it."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1173870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172350, "text": "Get rid of him. He's dead weight."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1176910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175150, "text": "Thanks for coming down, Judge. Sorry."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1180210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177190, "text": "You gotta go. We won't have time for any\nof your little stories."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1181569, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180570, "text": "I just got here."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1182570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181570, "text": "Take him backstage."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1183690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182690, "text": "Get my T -shirt."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1188910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185810, "text": "Hey, two minutes ago, you said I was the\nmost interesting guest you ever had."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1190330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189290, "text": "That was two minutes ago."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1192090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190710, "text": "Now you're yesterday's news."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1194030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192330, "text": "Nobody cares about you anymore."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1196750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194870, "text": "Go on. Get out of here."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1204470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203370, "text": "Who was that guy?"}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1208790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207730, "text": "And that's a wrap."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1214810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1212830, "text": "Guess I'll see everyone tomorrow, huh?"}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1220330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218130, "text": "Mac, were there any calls for me\ntonight?"}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1224310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220710, "text": "Uh, just one. Meryl Streep called to say\nshe got a new phone number."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1229650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224710, "text": "Well, that's nice. To know that there's\nat least one person who is not swayed by"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1231870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229650, "text": "the shifting sands of public opinion."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1233600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232600, "text": "What's your new number?"}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1234720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233720, "text": "She wouldn't say."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1242560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240620, "text": "Anybody feel like going and grabbing a\nbite?"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1249500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245020, "text": "Oh, Harry, as much as I would dearly\nlove to break bread with you, I'm"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1252400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249500, "text": "presenting a check tonight to Cub Scout\nDen 462."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1255980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252920, "text": "I've just enough time to rush home and\nice those cupcakes I baked for them."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1259860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1257320, "text": "The youth of America must be served."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1266770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265770, "text": "Christine, are you busy?"}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1269970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267290, "text": "I'm sorry. I feel a cold coming on."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1278430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275390, "text": "Boy, Mac, I'm telling you, fame is one\nfickle creature."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1279629, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278710, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1280630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279630, "text": "Oh, man, look at me."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1285750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280990, "text": "I mean, in one night, I went from being\nsomebody to being a big fat nobody."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1288830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286450, "text": "Well, sir, you were always somebody to\nus."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1293270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289430, "text": "It's just that for a few days there, you\nwere somebody stupid."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1296980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295980, "text": "Thank you, Matt."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1298320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297320, "text": "Anytime."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1308100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307100, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1309300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1308300, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1315140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309860, "text": "I was feeling a little better, and I\nhave nothing to do tonight, so..."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1318700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315140, "text": "You're so wonderful."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1322280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320820, "text": "And I'm such a jerk."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1329210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324810, "text": "I put all that celebrity stuff ahead of\nthe people that really matter to me."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1333910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330610, "text": "So can I make it up to you by springing\nfor a big night out on the town?"}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1338590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334890, "text": "Well, actually, I do have a pair of\ntickets for something. Oh, no, forget"}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1339509, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338590, "text": "You wouldn't be interested."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1342570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339510, "text": "No, I would, really. No matter what it\nis, you can count me in. What is it?"}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1345030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343290, "text": "The Lower Manhattan Quilting Symposium."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1348790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347490, "text": "A quilting symposium."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1353010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350750, "text": "Wow. That sounds..."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1356730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1355730, "text": "Interesting. Let's go."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1361610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1359770, "text": "Ross, take it easy."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1363390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361930, "text": "Don't do anything crazy."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1368710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364010, "text": "I'm headed with you, you cuteness, you\nchetness, you vegetarian meatloaf."}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1370610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369130, "text": "Aha, we got a winner here."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1372010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1370830, "text": "Thursday with a frying pan."}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1374150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1372450, "text": "Okay, so who gets the 500 bucks?"}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1377670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374670, "text": "Thursday, frying pan, the winner is R\n.R."}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1381370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1378750, "text": "Who's R .R.? Ross Russell."}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1386100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1385100, "text": "Dinner at 21?"}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1388320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1387320, "text": "Delighted."}
